id: determined
name: Determined
kind: state
description: >
  One last effort, and then nothing left.
text: >
  Narrative Requirement: A great need that shifts away all reason, directing all of your energy into this one moment. You have blocked out everything but the battle before you.
  (1)-[Passive]: Your Attacking Maneuvers automatically hit their targets, regardless of any Clashes or effects. You may still roll your Strike Roll for the purpose of assessing if you scored a Critical Result.
  (2)-[Passive]: You ignore the penalties of any Health Thresholds.
  (3)-[Automatic/Start of Turn]: Leave this State and then skip this turn. This effect applies before any other effects that occur at the start of the turn.

---

# (1) Every target hit without a defence rolled - the Strike Roll still made, for its Critical (chat.mjs resolveAttackWork).
# (2)
[passive]
attack.autoHit = true;
threshold.penalty = 0;

# (3) As your turn begins, whichever time that is: left, and the turn skipped (combat.mjs beginTurn reads `turn.skip`). It
# was once an Encounter - `first` - so a second Determined in the same Encounter never left nor skipped.
[automatic/start-of-turn]
leaveState("Determined");
turn.skip = true;
